who is the glomide queen if you're like  me this is a question you never asked  through your entire first playthrough i  had never heard any dialogue read any  item descriptions or held the attention  span required to even notice that there  was a mention of a gloam-eyed queen then  i started to hunt for more answers  regarding the godskin characters and  what is meant by the phrase destined  death which is mentioned quite often by  melano and malakath so here's what i  found out while lore hunting in elden  ring these videos are meant to be fun  speculation and to start discussions  that can lead to other interesting  theories so please discuss calmly and  respectfully down in the comments also  youtube told me that 98 of people that  watch my videos are not subscribed which  made me very sad so hit the subscribe  button so i can stop crying myself to  sleep at night thank you so let's get  into the video let's start by reading  some item descriptions regarding the  glomide queen i started with reading the  descriptions of godskin weapons spells  and armor sets the godskin apostle set  reads the apostles once said to serve  destined death are wielders of the god  slain black flame but after their defeat  by malakath the blackblade the source of  their power was sealed away the god  slayer's greatsword reads sacred sword  of the dust-eyed queen who controlled  the godskin apostles before her defeat  at the hands of malakath the black  flames protection spell reads the  apostles were all embraced by the  glomide queen and the black flame was  their armor within here's what we  learned from these three items one the  glomide queen and her apostles served  destined death two she was well loved by  her apostles and gave them the power to  defend themselves against gods three  when malakath defeated them and sealed  away destined death he also took that  power from them we can also take from  all of this that the glomide queen was  the previous guardian of destin death  before malakath we now know that  malaketh defeated her and sealed it away  upon queen america's request but who is  or was the gloam-eyed queen reading the  black flame ritual spell says the  glomide queen led the apostles it is  said that she was an imperian chosen by  the fingers so from this we can narrow  it down slightly we know that she is  full imperium the same as mykola melania  and ronnie we know that her time in the  lands between was during the age of the  golden order since she was assisted by  her own fingers we can also assume that  the glomide queen is likely one of  america's direct offspring since being  an emperian is only possible from this  at least that's the only way we know how  one can become an empirian but if this  is the case why would queen america send  malakath to defeat one of her own kids  and seal away destined death well the  most likely theory is that queen merica  feared death itself or  feared what the glomide queen wanted to  do with destined death in hand the black  flame monk armor reads the black flame  monks enthralled by the god slain black  flame became traitors abandon their  posts as guardians the seduction of a  taboo is never easily spurned so here's  a couple of ways we can interpret this  description 1. the glomide queen and her  followers began abusing the role as  godslayers or 2 the glomide queen's  followers turned against her now in my  opinion neither of these really matter  in the grand scheme of things the point  is that this family cult team whatever  you want to call it with the glomide  queen broke apart and left her  vulnerable it's possible that she was  defeated by her own followers after they  sided with malaka this could be why the  godskin duo and the maleketh boss fights  are in the same area of pharaoh azula  they're super close together so with all  of this information in mind i believe  that the gloam-eyed queen is melana the  glomide queen was empyrean guided by the  greater will assisted by the two fingers  and was the previous guardian of  destined death i think this dialogue by  melina pretty much proves her to be the  glomide queen  me  i'm searching  for my purpose  given to me by my mother inside the  urgery  long ago  for the reason that i yet live  burned  and bodyless  she was given her purpose from her  mother inside the urgery which almost  100 percent has to be queen america she  lost her purpose long ago which was  likely to protect destin death she also  states that although she is burned and  bodiless she still lives  burned meaning possibly burned by the  black flame of her previous followers  almost everything points to melano being  the glomide queen and if you aren't  convinced yet listen to what she says if  you inherit the frenzied flame  you  have inherited the frenzied flame  a pity  you are no longer fit  our journey together  ends here  and remember  should you rise as the lord of chaos  i will kill you  as sure as night follows day  such is my duty  for allowing you the strength of runes  she says her duty is to kill the lord of  chaos and if you go through with the  flame of frenzy ending she says this  lord or frenzied flame  i will seek you  as far as you may travel  to deliver you what is yours  destined death  so let's sum up everything we've learned  melano was born of queen america at the  foot of the urgery and given a purpose  by the greater will which was to  disperse destined death to all equally  throughout the lands between so either  she got too ambitious with this power or  queen america started getting  anti-greater will and queen america felt  threatened she commanded meliketh to  take the power of destined death from  melania and seal it away malaketh  defeated her and removed her  gloam-colored eye and her body was burnt  using the black flame of her previous  followers this would explain why one of  melania's eyes are missing and if we  look at the beast eye it looks like a  faded out gloam color that reminds me a  lot of mel in his eye in the flame of  frenzy ending this act by queen america  was likely the first action taken  against the golden order which led to  everything else spiraling out of control  in the lands between and eventually  started the shattering of eldon ring i  truly believe melina is the glomide  queen and is a much more important  character in the story of elden ring  itself than i ever could have imagined  however let's get a bit deeper with this  queen america was herself an emperian  empyrean can be interpreted as a title  or something born from a great rune  itself ronnie seems to be born of a  great rune the one that ratagon gives to  rinala it's possible that the glomide  queen was born from the rune of death  maybe she was the rune of death so when  ronnie stole a fragment of the rune of  death she also stole a fragment of the  glomide queen by offering her body and  godwin's soul to death ronnie brought  back the glomide queen in the form of  melania because godwin and ronnie were  used in this process melania still  shares a lot of connections between them  one she still has burn marks on her body  because ronnie's body was burned two she  is still somehow connected to ronnie's  soul as shown by her face being stuck to  ronnie's face three she is still somehow  connected to godwin's body through the  roots of the earth tree godwin's body  spreads the death roots maybe this is  what allows melanoma to walk the lands  between and why she gets stronger when  we get closer to the er tree it's all  possible that after we release the rune  of death from malakath the glomide queen  received all of her powers back so maybe  the melanoma we see in the frenzied  flame ending is no longer melano but the  glomide queen herself  let me know what you guys think down in  the comments again don't forget to  subscribe to the channel it helps me out  a lot thank you so much for all the  support i'll keep making videos if you  guys keep watching them have a great  rest of your day and i'll see you all in  the next video take care
 

